{% comment %}
  Negotiation widget mount point.

  Deliberately thin: which pages this shows on, brand colors/voice, trigger
  rules (always-on, dwell-time, exit-intent, revisit, cohort/email token),
  and the ladder-driven copy are ALL merchant-configured from this app's own
  embedded admin - not from Theme Editor block settings - per the brief's
  "zero code/theme changes required per merchant" rule. The widget script
  below fetches that config at runtime, scoped by shop domain.

  This is an app EMBED block (target: body), not an app block: the merchant
  turns it on once under Theme Editor > App embeds, and it then renders on
  every page, same as any floating chat widget. That matches the "anywhere
  the merchant wants" placement decision - page-level visibility is runtime
  logic in the script, not per-page theme placement.
{% endcomment %}
<div
  id="scopegen-nego-widget"
  data-shop="{{ shop.permanent_domain }}"
  data-page-type="{{ request.page_type }}"
  {% if product %}data-product-id="gid://shopify/Product/{{ product.id }}"{% endif %}
></div>
<script src="{{ 'negotiation-widget.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Negotiation widget",
  "target": "body"
}
{% endschema %}
